My own Findings 9–12 cite §2d.4/§2d.5/§2d.6, so I re-read §2d.4 at its **actual** L534:568 to make sure
I hadn't quoted a drifted region. Finding 11's quote of (c) is verbatim-correct, and §2d.4's closing rule
— *"key present and `<= 0` ⇒ veto"* — is exactly what `needsScaleDownForRole` already implements
PRC-independently, which is Finding 11's substance. **No prior finding of mine needs correcting.**

